Phase 16 — Production Go-Live Certification

This phase is not about building features.

It is about proving the system is safe.

Components
1. End-to-End Validation

Verify:

Market Data → Strategy → Risk → OMS → Ledger → Exchange → Reconciliation
No dual state
No orphan orders
No ghost positions
No replay divergence
2. Stress Testing

Run:

10M+ event replay
Extreme BTC volatility days
Exchange disconnects
Network latency spikes
Database failover scenarios
3. Chaos Engineering

Intentionally break:

OMS
Redis
TimescaleDB
Vault
Exchange connections
Network links

Verify automatic recovery.

4. Security Certification

Perform:

Penetration testing
JWT bypass testing
RBAC escalation testing
Secret leakage scanning
Container security scans
5. Reconciliation Certification

Prove:

Exchange is always authority
No drift remains unresolved
Recovery actions are deterministic

